<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">NAHUM</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc3">Na</para>
  <para style="mt1">NAHUM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1" />Pwofesi pou Ninive. Liv vizyon a Nahum nan, Elkochit la. <verse eid="NAM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2" />Yon Dye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32:35</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 32:41">41</ref> </char></note>jalou k ap fè vanjans se SENYÈ a. SENYÈ a plen chalè kòlè ak vanjans. SENYÈ a ap pran vanjans Li sou sa yo ki kont Li yo. Sou lènmi Li yo, li konsève chalè kòlè Li. <verse eid="NAM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3" />SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Egz 34:6</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 34:7">7</ref> </char></note>lan nan kòlè, e Li plen pwisans. Konsa, li byen si ke SENYÈ a p ap kite koupab la san pinisyon. Mwayen Li se nan toubiyon ak tanpèt, e nwaj yo se pousyè anba pye Li. <verse eid="NAM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:15">Jos 3:15</ref>,<ref loc="JOS 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:9">És 33:9</ref> </char></note>Repwoche lanmè a, e fè l vin sèch. Li fè larivyè yo vin sèch. Basan ak Carmel seche; flè a Liban yo vin fennen. <verse eid="NAM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5" />Mòn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Egz 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:1">És 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 24:20">20</ref> </char></note>tranble akoz Li, e kolin yo vin fann nèt. Anverite latè a boulvèse pa prezans Li, lemonn ak tout sa ki rete ladann. <verse eid="NAM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6" />Se kilès ki ka kanpe devan gwo kòlè Li? Kilès ki ka sipòte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:13">És 13:13</ref></char></note>chalè kòlè Li? Se tankou dife <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15">És 66:15</ref> </char></note>kòlè Li vide; Li menm ki fè wòch yo kraze an mòso. <verse eid="NAM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7" />SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:8">Sòm 25:8</ref> </char></note>bon; se yon sitadèl nan jou malè. Epi Li konnen sila ki pran refij nan li yo. <verse eid="NAM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8" />Men tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:2">És 28:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 28:17">17</ref> </char></note>inondasyon ki debòde nèt, li va fè vil Ninive disparèt nèt, e kouri dèyè lènmi Li yo jis rive nan fènwa. <verse eid="NAM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9" />Nenpòt panse nou konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Sòm 2:1</ref></char></note>fè kont SENYÈ a, li va mete fen a sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:22">És 28:22</ref> </char></note>nèt. Gwo twoub sa a p ap parèt de fwa. <verse eid="NAM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10" />Kon bwa pikan mele mare, kon sila ki sou ak bwason yo, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:24">És 5:24</ref> </char></note> vin konsonmen nèt kon pay ki fennen nèt. <verse eid="NAM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11" />Nan ou, te sòti yon moun ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:7-11">És 10:7-11</ref></char></note> fè move konplo kont SENYÈ a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:2">Éz 11:2</ref> </char></note>konseye mechan.<verse eid="NAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12" />Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Byenke yo plen fòs, e yo gen anpil moun; malgre sa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:16-19">És 10:16-19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:33">33</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:34">34</ref></char></note>vin koupe retire e disparèt. Byenke Mwen te aflije ou, Mwen p ap aflije ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:31">Lam 3:31</ref>,<ref loc="LAM 3:32">32</ref> </char></note>ankò. <verse eid="NAM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13" />Pou sa, koulye a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:4">És 9:4</ref> </char></note>kraze retire jouk li ki mare sou ou a, e mwen va eklate chèn ou yo.”<verse eid="NAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14" />SENYÈ a fin pase lòd konsènan ou menm: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:17">Job 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:22">Éz 32:22</ref> </char></note>“P ap gen desandan ki pou pote non ou ankò. Mwen va koupe retire zidòl ak imaj soti lakay dye ou yo. M ap prepare yon kote antèman pou ou; paske ou vin abominab.”<verse eid="NAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 1:15" />Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:9">És 40:9</ref> </char></note>sou mòn yo, pye a li ki pote bòn nouvèl, ki anonse lapè yo! Fè fèt nou, O Juda! Akonpli ve nou yo. Paske sa p ap janm rive ankò pou mechan sila an vin pase nan mitan nou. Li fin koupe retire nèt.<verse eid="NAM 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1" />Sila ki konn kaze brize a gen tan monte kont ou. Kenbe fò a! Veye chemen an! Ranfòse ren ou! Ranmase tout kouraj ou!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:20-23">Jr 51:20-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="NAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2" />Paske SENYÈ a va restore tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:15">És 60:15</ref> </char></note>glwa a Jacob, menm jan ak glwa Israël la, paske piyajè yo fin piyaje yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:12">Sòm 80:12</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 80:13">13</ref></char></note>rache branch rezen li yo.<verse eid="NAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3" />Boukliye a mesye pwisan li yo vin wouj. Gèrye yo vin abiye an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:14">Éz 23:14</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 23:15">15</ref> </char></note>kramwazi. Cha yo klere an asye nan jou derape a. Lans an bwa pichpen yo vin parèt. <verse eid="NAM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15">És 66:15</ref> </char></note>Cha yo kouri fou nan lari. Yo sikile san kontwòl sou wout yo. Aparans yo tankou tòch, yo kouri patou tankou kout loray. <verse eid="NAM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5" />Li rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 3:18">Na 3:18</ref></char></note>gèye pi chwa li yo. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:12">Jr 46:12</ref> </char></note>manke tonbe nan fòme yo. Yo prese rive nan miray la. Gwo barikàd syèj defans la fin prepare. <verse eid="NAM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6" />Pòtay rivyè yo ouvri e palè a fin kraze nèt. <verse eid="NAM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7" />Bagay la fin fèt; Ninive vin toutouni, li fin pote ale nèt. Sèvant li yo ap plenyen ak vwa toutrèl; y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:12">És 32:12</ref> </char></note>bat lestonmak yo. <verse eid="NAM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8" />Men Ninive te tankou ti lak dlo depi lontan; malgre sa, y ap sove ale. “Rete, Rete”! Yo kriye fò, Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:5">Jr 46:5</ref> </char></note>pèsòn pa gade dèyè. <verse eid="NAM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9" />Pran piyaj ajan! Pran piyaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:12">Rev 18:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:16">16</ref> </char></note>lò! Paske gen trezò san limit—gen valè nan tout bagay presye yo. <verse eid="NAM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10" />Li vin vid nèt! Wi, li vin dezole e gate. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:14">Sòm 22:14</ref> </char></note>Kè yo ap fann e jenou yo si tèlman ap sekwe, youn bat lòt. Doulè ak laperèz domine tout kò a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:6">Jl 2:6</ref></char></note>figi yo vin blèm! <verse eid="NAM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11" />Kote fòs lyon yo ye? Kote plas la tout jenn lyon yo te manje? Kote andwa a manman lyon an ak ti lyon an te konn mache? Plas la kote okenn pa t konn fè yo pè? <verse eid="NAM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12" />Lyon an te kon chire viktim yo an mòso ase pou manje ti lyon li yo. Li te touye pou manman lyon li yo. Li te plen kav li ak chè ki dechire e tanyè li ak viktim. <verse eid="NAM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13" />“Gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:13">Jr 21:13</ref> </char></note>Mwen kont ou”, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. “Mwen va brile cha lagè li yo nan lafimen. Nepe a va devore jenn lyon ou yo. Mwen va retire nan peyi a, tout chè nou te konn manje. Konsa, vwa mesaje nou yo p ap tande ankò.”<verse eid="NAM 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:6">Éz 2:6</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 2:9">9</ref> </char>
    </note>Malè a vil sanglan an! Li plen nèt ak manti ak piyaj. Viktim li yo san fen. <verse eid="NAM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 39:22-25">Job 39:22-25</ref> </char></note>Bri a fwèt la, bri a wou k ap sone sou wòch yo, cheval k ap galope yo ak cha k ap vòltije yo! <verse eid="NAM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3" />Chevalye k ap kouri desann yo; nepe k ap klere yo, lans k ap briye tankou solèy yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:3">És 34:3</ref></char></note>Anpil mò, yon gwo ma kadav, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:36">És 37:36</ref> </char></note>kò mouri san kontwòl— yo manke tonbe sou kadav mò yo! <verse eid="NAM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4" />Tout sa akoz anpil aktivite a pwostitiye yo, sila ki vrèman byen pòtan yo, mètrès a gwo maji yo, ki vann nasyon yo nan pwostitisyon li yo, ak fanmi yo nan gwo wanga li konn fè yo. <verse eid="NAM 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5" />“Gade byen, Mwen vin kont ou”, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:2">És 47:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 47:3">3</ref> </char></note>Leve jip ou jis rive nan figi ou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:37">Éz 16:37</ref></char></note>montre a nasyon yo toutouni ou, pou wayòm yo wè wont ou. <verse eid="NAM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6" />Mwen va jete bagay ki sal nèt sou ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:8">Job 30:8</ref></char></note>fè ou vin avili e fè ou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:16">És 14:16</ref> </char></note> espektak. <verse eid="NAM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7" />Konsa, li va vin rive ke tout moun ki wè ou, yo va fè bak, e yo va di: “Men Ninive fin devaste nèt! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:19">És 51:19</ref> </char></note>Se kilès k ap fè dèy pou li? Se kibò pou m ta jwenn moun ki pou rekonfòte ou?”<verse eid="NAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8" />Èske ou pi bon pase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:25">Jr 46:25</ref> </char></note>Nò Amon ki te pozisyone pami rivyè yo, ki te antoure ak dlo, ki te gen lanmè kon pwotèj li, e se lanmè ki te sèvi kon miray li? <verse eid="NAM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9" />Se Éthiopie ki te pwisans li, ansanm ak Égypte ki te san limit. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:9">Jr 46:9</ref></char></note>Puth ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:3">II Kwo 12:3</ref> </char></note>Libie te pami soutyen ou yo. <verse eid="NAM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10" />Men li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:4">És 19:4</ref> </char></note>pote ale; li te antre an kaptivite. Tout ti pitit li yo te vin kraze an mòso nan tèt tout ri yo. Yo te fè tiraj osò pou onorab li yo, e mesye pwisan li yo te mare nan chèn. <verse eid="NAM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11" />Ou menm tou va vin sou nèt. Ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">És 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 2:19">19</ref> </char></note>kache. Ou menm tou va chache yon kote pou ou kache akoz de ènmi an. <verse eid="NAM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12" />Tout gwo fò nou yo va tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:13">Rev 6:13</ref></char></note>pye fig etranje ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:4">És 28:4</ref> </char></note>fwi ki mi— lè yo sekwe yo, yo tonbe nan bouch a sila k ap manje yo a. <verse eid="NAM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13" />Gade byen, pèp ou a se fanm yo ye pami nou! Pòtay peyi ou yo vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:1">És 45:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 45:2">2</ref> </char></note>ouvri byen laj bay lènmi ou yo. Dife fin devore baryè pòtay ou yo.<verse eid="NAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:3">II Kwo 32:3</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 32:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 2:1">Na 2:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Rale dlo ou pou kont ou pou fè syèj la! Ranfòse fò ou yo! Antre nan ajil la, e foule mòtye a anba pye ou. Byen bati kay fou k ap fè brik yo fò! <verse eid="NAM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15" />La, dife sa menm va vin devore ou nèt. Nepe va koupe retire ou nèt. Li va devore ou tankou krikèt volan. Li va fè ou vin anpil tankou yon krikèt volan. Li va fè ou vin anpil tankou krikèt. <verse eid="NAM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16" />Ou fin ogmante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:8">És 23:8</ref> </char></note>machann ou yo plis pase zetwal syèl yo— krikèt volan ravaje, epi, konsa, li vole ale. <verse eid="NAM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:7">Rev 9:7</ref></char></note>Gad nou yo tankou krikèt. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:27">Jr 51:27</ref> </char></note>Jandam nou yo tankou gwo lame krikèt volan k ap poze sou wòch nan jou fredi. Lè solèy la leve yo sove ale. Kote yo rive a, pèsòn pa konnen.<verse eid="NAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18" />Bèje ou yo ap dòmi, O wa Assyrie. Prens ou yo kouche nèt. Pèp ou an vin gaye sou mòn yo, e nanpwen moun ki pou rasanble yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:5">Sòm 76:5</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 76:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">I Wa 22:17</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="NAM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19" />Nanpwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:11">Jr 46:11</ref></char></note>ti pansman pou sa k ap fè ou mal la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:12">Jr 30:12</ref> </char></note>Blesi ou a p ap ka geri. Tout moun ki tande koze ou va bat men yo sou ou, paske kilès moun san rete, ki pa t resevwa nan mechanste ou?<verse eid="NAM 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3" />
</usx>